{
  "_note": "详情页页头:城市名 + 时效锚(这一页数据取回来的时刻)。\n页头 = 大标题(24pt)+ 右上角时效锚(mk_anchor 共享件,点一下 = 下拉刷新同一条流)。\n锚的文字 `${upd}` 是**这份数据取回来的时刻**(本机时间;当天 HH:mm、跨天 MM-DD HH:mm),\n与详情页 hero 里的「截至 09:00(当地时间)」不是一回事 —— 后者是模型时次,属于数据本身。\n还没有时间(首次取数前)就不画锚:mk_anchor 的 RCN 版没有「只剩图标」那一态。",
  "rc": {
    "cells": [
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${city},__none__),__none__),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "3pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-120pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "text": "${city}",
            "fontSize": "24pt",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "lineBreak": "0"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${city},__none__),__none__),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "11.88pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-120pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "text": "--",
            "fontSize": "24pt",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "lineBreak": "0"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "at",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "{parent.w}-{at.w}",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "-1",
        "h": "26pt",
        "alignmentV": "1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "${upd}",
        "fontSize": "12pt",
        "typeface": "System",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "bgColor": "#0E0E1116|#14F3F4F6",
        "paddingLeft": "26pt",
        "paddingRight": "10pt",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "13pt",
          "leftB": "13pt",
          "rightT": "13pt",
          "rightB": "13pt"
        },
        "_note": "时效锚(page-design-system §1.1)—— 由 tools/infosource/mk_anchor.py rcn_nodes() 生成,改规格改那里。",
        "events": {
          "onClick": {
            "flow": "@[file://page/flow/refresh-detail.af]",
            "params": {}
          }
        },
        "hide": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${upd}),0),0,1)]"
      },
      {
        "id": "atIc",
        "type": "path",
        "x": "{at.x}+8pt",
        "y": "{at.y}+6.5pt",
        "w": "13pt",
        "h": "13pt",
        "viewBox": "0 0 256 256",
        "d": "M224,48V96a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H168a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h28.69L182.06,73.37a79.56,79.56,0,0,0-56.13-23.43h-.45A79.52,79.52,0,0,0,69.59,72.71,8,8,0,0,1,58.41,61.27a96,96,0,0,1,135,.79L208,76.69V48a8,8,0,0,1,16,0ZM186.41,183.29a80,80,0,0,1-112.47-.66L59.31,168H88a8,8,0,0,0,0-16H40a8,8,0,0,0-8,8v48a8,8,0,0,0,16,0V179.31l14.63,14.63A95.43,95.43,0,0,0,130,222.06h.53a95.36,95.36,0,0,0,67.07-27.33,8,8,0,0,0-11.18-11.44Z",
        "fillColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "hide": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${upd}),0),0,1)]"
      }
    ],
    "i18n": {
      "zh-CN": {},
      "en-US": {}
    }
  }
}
